---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy & Data Flow — MOZHIVORA"
  description="Plain-language privacy policy, GDPR & India DPDP Act 2023 compliance, and zero-training guarantee."
  canonicalPath="/privacy/"
>
  <article class="container" style="padding: 48px 24px; max-width: var(--reading-width);">
    <h1 style="font-family: var(--font-serif); color: var(--color-ink-teal); font-size: 2.25rem;">Privacy &amp; Data Flow</h1>
    <p style="color: var(--color-stone);">Plain-language summary · Compliant with GDPR, India DPDP Act 2023, and CCPA.</p>
    <h2>1. Your files are never used to train models</h2>
    <p>Documents, chats, notes, and voice recordings are processed solely to fulfill your request. We never log prompts, responses, or file contents in server logs.</p>
    <h2>2. Full Export &amp; One-Click Deletion</h2>
    <p>You can export your workspace as a ZIP archive or permanently delete your account and all associated data from Settings at any time.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
